# .brix — Grain
# Course descriptor: name, version, and the bricks (source files) Mantra tracks.
# Format: one key-value pair per line, space-separated. Lines starting with
# '#' are comments; blank lines are ignored.
#
# Molted 20260810.145743 from the elder "veganreyklah2" descriptor
# (version 20260629.004912) for fascia health: current name (Grain), current
# version, and the modules grown since June added as bricks. The elder
# descriptor lives whole in git history (accrete-never-break); the old
# identity-flavored name leaves the living tree.
#
# Keys:
#   name     — the project name (one value)
#   version  — descriptor version (Rye chronological stamp)
#   file     — one tracked brick/source file (multiple, in order)
#   alias    — typo resolution (from to). Seated 20260727.235754.

name grain
version 20260810.145743

# Typo resolution (Brix) — Prim was a mis-hear of Prin
alias Prim Prin

# The six bodies and their synthesis (seated 20260827.212800, Keaton's word). Three
# presence-and-absence pairs -- Mind/Mystery, Sound/Silence, Dream/Hush -- and CHOIR, the seventh
# launch that is not a seventh hand: one voice performing all six lanes in one bounded round, only
# while every loop is stopped. Synonym discipline: "synthesis launch" and "the seventh seat" are
# spoken forms of Choir; neither is a second implementation (alias-sameness).
alias Synthesis Choir
file tools/l/launch-choir-synthesis-chapter.rish

# Rye compiler
file rye/src/main.rye

# Rishi shell
file rishi/src/main.rye

# Tally memory model
file tally/seed.rye
file tally/gardens.rye

# Caravan supervision
file caravan/seed.rye
file caravan/bounded.rye
file caravan/twin.rye
file caravan/chain.rye

# Mantra version control
file mantra/src/main.rye

# Gate trio — Rishi only (tools/*.rish)
file tools/p/parity.rish

# Ember, the inference vane (Lattice · Scribble · Lantern · Kiln) -- named 20260827, REDS %300;
# elder name Q-vane stays a readable peer. The craft faculty is Kiln from 20260827.195316.
file lattice/lattice_core.rye
file scribble/scribble_core.rye
file lantern/lantern_core.rye
file ember/ember_core.rye

# Identity and topology (Kumara · Comlink)
file kumara/kumara.rye
file comlink/topology.rye

# Sundial — the health face
file sundial/sundial.rye

# Living documentation
file construction/ROADMAP.md
file construction/TASKS.md
